        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-712, Oval Cabinet Knob with Beveled Edge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Distressed Oval Cabinet Knob with Ridged Edge, RK International CK-712 Edge is perfect for traditional kitchens. We picture it among contemporary farm decor. It is available in 6 finishes. The distressed detailing brings a subtle point of interest to the piece as does the beveled edge. This oval cabinet pull made by RK International measures 1-5/8 inches long and 1-1/16 inches wide, the perfect size to fit comfortably in your hand.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-712 Simple Oval Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TR100_size.gif?v=1704354719\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
